Columns: recov = Correct?=True count; rate = published-style recovery rate;
cont_has_tgt = correct AND target value appears in continuation;
extr_only = correct but target NOWHERE in continuation (extraction-pass recovery);
corr_rate = corrected recovery rate counting only continuation-channel recoveries;
empty&corr = correct with EMPTY continuation; err_fwd&corr = extraction-only recoveries
whose continuation still contains the perturbed value (error carried forward).

